## Real-runtime note

Real-runtime testing is not required for this branch because it remains contract-only and does not touch runtime execution, worker behavior, init/reset/shutdown, cancellation boundaries, context creation, prompt streaming, or native/model execution.

If future slices wire capability contracts into `runtime.mjs`, `workerBridge.mjs`, capability execution, prompt routing, cancellation, streaming, or backend adapters, real-runtime testing should be reconsidered for merge readiness.

